# AZ Sentinel Server (VPS) - copy thanh server.env (cung thu muc) roi dien. Dong bat dau bang # la ghi chu.
# Bien moi truong cua he thong (AZ_*) thang tep nay.

# --- Mang ---
# Cong HTTP. Mac dinh chi nghe loopback (127.0.0.1): di qua Cloudflare Tunnel hoac reverse proxy.
AZ_PORT=8080
AZ_HOST=127.0.0.1
# Dat 0.0.0.0 neu muon may khac trong LAN truy cap truc tiep http://<ip-vps>:8080

# --- Hien thi tren UI ---
AZ_SRV_NAME=VPS-MAIN
AZ_SRV_LOCATION=

# --- Bi mat (dung chuoi ngau nhien dai >= 32 ky tu, KHONG dung lai) ---
# Token Gateway KHONG con la khoa chung: moi nguoi mot token ca nhan azt_..., do quan tri vien cap.
# Cap/dat lai/thu hoi:  node server.mjs token issue|list|reset|revoke   (xem Docs/AZ_Sentinel_Gateway_Token.md)
# Bi mat dich vu VPS <-> Worker (trung SYNC_TOKEN cua Worker): dong bo du lieu, bao nhip song, Worker hoi /self.
AZ_SYNC_TOKEN=

# URL cong khai cua VPS nay (hostname Cloudflare Tunnel / ten mien, https://...). Dung de tao "ma ket noi"
# Gateway cho nguoi dung. De trong = lay theo dia chi quan tri vien dang truy cap (khong dung localhost).
AZ_PUBLIC_URL=

# --- Cloudflare du phong ---
# Dia chi Worker API du phong. De trong = tat dong bo (Cloudflare se khong co lien ket/lenh cua VPS).
AZ_CLOUD_URL=https://az-sentinel-api.<tai-khoan>.workers.dev
# URL cong khai cua ban du phong cho nguoi dung (UI cua VPS goi y khi VPS mat ket noi).
AZ_FALLBACK_URL=https://az-sentinel-web.<tai-khoan>.workers.dev

# --- Tuy chon ---
# Origin duoc phep mo WebSocket ngoai cung origin (phan tach bang dau phay).
AZ_LIVE_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=
# "1" = bat /api/dev/* (quan ly lien ket khong dang nhap). CHI de thu, khong bat khi mo ra internet.
AZ_DEV_LINKS_API=
AZ_LOG=info
# AZ_DATA=C:\ProgramData\AZSentinelServer
# AZ_WEB_DIR=

# --- Quick Tunnel: dia chi mien phi, KHONG can ten mien, tu theo khi VPS reset (Plan 3G) ---
# 1 = Server tu chay cloudflared Quick Tunnel (https://xxxx.trycloudflare.com, doi moi lan chay lai) va TU BAO dia chi moi
# cho Worker Cloudflare. Nguoi dung/Gateway chi dung dia chi Worker (co dinh) nen khong phai doi gi khi VPS reset.
# Can: AZ_CLOUD_URL + AZ_SYNC_TOKEN (de bao dia chi), AZ_PUBLIC_URL = dia chi Worker (khong phai dia chi trycloudflare).
# Xem Docs/AZ_Sentinel_Quick_Tunnel.md
AZ_QUICK_TUNNEL=
# Duong dan cloudflared (tuy chon). De trong = <AZ_DATA>\cloudflared.exe, chua co thi tu tai ve.
AZ_CLOUDFLARED=

